cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Hephaestus in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Hephaestus
abstract: >-
  Hephaestus reviews the pull requests, issues, and code reviews your team already writes against
  the engineering practices you choose. It gives each developer feedback that cites their work and
  names a next step.
authors:
  - name: TUM Applied Education Technologies
    website: https://aet.cit.tum.de/
repository-code: https://github.com/hephaestus-build/Hephaestus
url: https://hephaestus.build
license: MIT
keywords:
  - practice-feedback
  - engineering-practices
  - developer-feedback
  - self-hosted
